    "display_title": "chore(ci): metrics-archive keeps the bench and sim-checks logs before they expire",
    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "chore/metrics-archive",
    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): metrics-archive keeps the bench and sim-checks logs before they expire\n\nSpec 43 step 1. A hand-started workflow runs ci/metrics/archive_runs.py,\nwhich writes each completed run's Actions API record (run, jobs, steps,\nrunner image, bench's inputs from its log's env blocks) as\nmetrics/raw/<series>/<run id>.json, and its log as <run id>.log: the\nwhole log for bench, the digest and scaling jobs for sim-checks. Runs\nalready archived are skipped; an expired log is {\"na\": \"not-recorded\"}.\nIt stops short of the token's hourly limit, and pushes the files on a\nbranch chore/metrics-archive-<date> for the owner to open a PR from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi27hiWYpRQB4fhW5kr",
